WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:01.793
Hey, you!

00:00:01.835 --> 00:00:02.669
Huh?

00:00:05.296 --> 00:00:07.632
You should be careful
of that sort of stuff.

00:00:07.882 --> 00:00:09.134
What sort of stuff?

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:11.177
I'm talking about Kana and Erika.

00:00:11.302 --> 00:00:12.137
What?

00:00:12.512 --> 00:00:16.349
Anyone who makes friends
with a transfer student...

00:00:16.474 --> 00:00:18.309
They usually have ulterior motives.

00:00:18.977 --> 00:00:24.190
The class losers make friends with new
students because they have no friends.

00:00:26.651 --> 00:00:28.737
Today we're playing soccer for gym class.

00:00:30.155 --> 00:00:30.989
There!

00:00:35.326 --> 00:00:36.161
Huh?

00:00:36.661 --> 00:00:40.373
Well, whether you're good at soccer or not
has nothing to do with life.

00:00:41.666 --> 00:00:42.500
Arf!

00:00:44.878 --> 00:00:48.048
Huh. Yamada might actually be cool.

00:00:48.339 --> 00:00:50.383
-Here it comes, Watanabe!
-Huh?

00:00:50.842 --> 00:00:52.177
Kick it in the goal!

00:00:57.348 --> 00:00:58.725
What a loser!

00:01:00.018 --> 00:01:02.020
Never mind! He's awful.

00:01:03.396 --> 00:01:05.690
No, no. Don't get mad.

00:01:06.107 --> 00:01:08.860
Well, that was embarrassing.

00:01:12.072 --> 00:01:14.866
What? What's going on?

00:01:18.036 --> 00:01:20.872
You better watch out
around that transfer student.

00:01:21.039 --> 00:01:24.417
She's telling everyone
that you two are bullying her.

00:01:24.542 --> 00:01:26.586
-That's horrible!
-Unbelievable!

00:01:26.878 --> 00:01:28.421
She's a scary woman.

00:01:28.546 --> 00:01:31.216
She can lie as easily as she can breathe.

00:01:31.257 --> 00:01:33.051
That's what you're doing!

00:01:33.093 --> 00:01:33.927
Babu?

00:01:36.096 --> 00:01:38.640
You're the one with the worst personality!

00:01:40.225 --> 00:01:41.893
Hey, sorry!

00:01:42.894 --> 00:01:45.396
It's 'cause you were just standing there.

00:01:46.439 --> 00:01:48.566
I can't stand it anymore.

00:01:48.608 --> 00:01:50.568
I'm sick of all of you!

00:01:56.616 --> 00:01:57.992
Babu!

00:02:05.458 --> 00:02:06.918
This is so cool

00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:07.794
Ouch...

